                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> When Naptha takes fire damage, the carbauxine gas leaking from her ignites, dealing @Damage[10[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to all other creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10].</p>"
