                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Naptha is holding or wearing a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Healer's Toolkit]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Naptha knits her own wounds or the wounds of an adjacent creature. She attempts a @Check[medicine] check with the same DC as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Treat Wounds] (up to DC 30) and restores the corresponding amount of HP. The target is then immune to Suture Wounds until it takes more damage.</p>"
